# ==============================================================================
# 70-hyprland.list: Hyprland Wayland Compositor & Desktop Dependencies
# ==============================================================================
# Instructions:
#  - Installed when using --hyprland or --all
#  - Excluded when using --basic
#  - Requires COPR: lionheartp/Hyprland (handled automatically by install.sh)
#  - Inline comments with '#' are fully supported
# ==============================================================================

# --- Wayland Compositor & Screensharing Portals ---
hyprland                    # Dynamic tiling Wayland compositor
xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland # Desktop portal backend for Hyprland screensharing
xdg-desktop-portal-gtk      # GTK desktop portal fallback

# --- Desktop Shell & UI Components ---
noctalia                    # Wayland desktop shell (bar, launcher, control center)
rofi                        # Window switcher and application runner
hyprshot                    # Screenshot utility for Hyprland

# --- File Management & Selection Utilities ---
slurp                       # Region selection tool for Wayland (used by hyprshot)
nautilus                    # GNOME file manager
